WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.220
Hi. I’m Kevin. Let’s talk about Vsauce2.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.280
When I first started making Vsauce videos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:14.220
Michael and I were each making different&nbsp;
shows for both Vsauce and Vsauce2. Vsauce!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:19.440
Kevin here. In the 11 years since I started&nbsp;
doing Vsauce2 full-time, I’ve developed a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:25.560
dozen formats across hundreds of videos that&nbsp;
have been viewed 3 quarters of a billion times.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:34.740
The truth is that the old YouTube is gone&nbsp;
-- everything is different now. I just feel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:40.620
like... making my style of educational&nbsp;
content sustainably is impossible.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.660
So…this channel as you know is just done.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:52.260
It’s just time that I do...&nbsp;
I don’t know… something else.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.720
Please bring back Mind Blow. Why did you&nbsp;
quit Mind Blow? Will there ever be another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:01.200
Mind Blow? Can we get more MindBlow?&nbsp;
Mind used to inspire and motive me...

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.980
Bring back Mind Blow.

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:16.620
Hey, Kevin. Bring back Mind Blow. You coward.

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:21.720
Hey, Kevin! Bring back Mind Blow!

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:22.920
Do it!

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:28.320
Bring back Mind Blow! Mind Blow, please!

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:38.880
Listen. Everyone. For the last time. I&nbsp;
am NOT bringing back Mind Blow. YOU ARE.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:43.560
Vsauce2 was built on the backbone of a show&nbsp;
highlighting the latest in science news,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:48.360
robotics, experimental technology, and&nbsp;
amazing inventions. Some things that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:53.880
seemed futuristic at the time like wireless&nbsp;
charging or digital face filters are now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:59.220
completely commonplace. Other things like&nbsp;
“invisibility skin” we’re still waiting on.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:03.420
It was called Mind Blow. I LOVED that show -- and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:09.240
it’s been 5 years since the last episode.&nbsp;
I even did a podcast about why I stopped,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:16.080
but everyday I receive comments from&nbsp;
you asking to bring back Mind Blow.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:20.160
So here it is. The Bring Back Mind Blow Project.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:26.580
YOU will produce brand new episodes of Mind&nbsp;
Blow starting right now. Your involvement in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:31.740
the Bring Back Mind Blow Project will directly&nbsp;
support hiring Emmy award-winning science writer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:37.800
Scott Frank. Say hi, Scott. “Hi Scott.” As well&nbsp;
hiring a dedicated researcher, video editor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:44.220
thumbnail artist, fact-checker, media manager, and&nbsp;
all the aspects of properly returning Mind Blow to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:51.660
Vsauce2. I’m even gonna end every episode with&nbsp;
the original NES cartridge squeeze Vsauce2 logo.

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:55.920
YOUR role as Producer will&nbsp;
include submitting story ideas,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.920 --> 00:03:00.360
voting on thumbnails, engaging in&nbsp;
great discussions about science news,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:06.960
and seeing your name credited for bringing&nbsp;
back Mind Blow. Because Mind Blow is your show.

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:12.360
The number of episodes every month is&nbsp;
up to you. We’ll start with one -- with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:17.460
your support we can make two, and if things&nbsp;
get really crazy I've got ideas for that.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:24.420
Not only will patrons receive exclusive bonus Mind&nbsp;
Blow content but I have a way bigger announcement&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:30.900
than that. The first Mind Blow episode in five&nbsp;
years is ALREADY DONE and it’s available to watch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:37.740
right now exclusively to patrons – this episode&nbsp;
will never be uploaded publicly to YouTube.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:42.480
It’s just for you. So if you want to&nbsp;
watch it you have to become part of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:47.700
The Bring Back Mind Blow Project. After&nbsp;
that every new episode will be uploaded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:53.040
for free to YouTube thanks entirely&nbsp;
to those of you who join the project.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:04:00.540
So now’s the time for you to become part of&nbsp;
Bringing Back Mind Blow. Go to Patreon.com/Vsauce2&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:06.840
or click the link in the description. I will still&nbsp;
be doing long-form, deep-dive videos -- there are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:13.140
a LOT of topics I want to investigate -- but you&nbsp;
are returning Mind Blow to this channel, too.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:19.260
Some of you grew up with Mind Blow. Some of&nbsp;
you now have kids old enough to watch Mind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:26.400
Blow with you. And yeah, YouTube has changed --&nbsp;
but with your help, we can do science news right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:32.160
again. Forget the content farms and every&nbsp;
other problem with YouTube. We’re going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:40.080
back to our roots. Reject modernity, return to&nbsp;
tradition -- and become a producer for Mind Blow.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:49.080
Patreon.com/Vsauce2. This is Mind Blow. YOU are&nbsp;
Mind Blow. Join the Bring Back Mind Blow Project.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:50.520
Now.

